    "id": "CPD4128035",
    "title": "Standby Management Consultancy & Professional Services (Strategy)",
    "description": "MHCLG is forming a partnership with a supplier for the delivery of specialist advice on areas related to high impact/significant problems or issues supporting Corporate Strategy and Government Policy which typically might involve interfacing and directly influencing Ministers. This may include identification of options with recommendations, as well as implementation and delivery.  The Supplier will build a relationship with MHCLG throughout the Contract term in order to understand the Department's values and objectives which, in turn, which enable the Supplier to delivery policy specific advice.\r\n\r\nAdditional information: This is a call-off from the Crown Commercial Service RM6187 Management Consultancy Framework Three (MCF3) / Lot 2.",
